& 2\\end{aligned}|+0|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4-n\\cdot 2+0 \\\\  & =4-2n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the determinant of the matrix is $-6,$ we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4-2n & =-6 \\\\ -2n & =-10 \\\\ n & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
